{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong><br>Step into a relentless <strong>2D pixel-art boss rush</strong> where every mis-fired bug is your secret weapon. Accidentally awaken swarms of \u201cbugs\u201d and unleash them on colossal bosses! Adapt on the fly, master chaos, and prove your reflexes in the ultimate pixel showdown. \ud83d\udca5\u2694\ufe0f</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Non-Stop Boss Rush</strong> \u2013 One brutal boss after another, each with unique attack patterns and punishing phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1b <strong>Bug-Triggering Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Accidentally trigger different bug species; each boasts distinct powers. Command them wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Precision Controls</strong> \u2013 Tight, responsive platforming and attack inputs demand razor-sharp reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Vivid, handcrafted visuals blending classic nostalgia with modern flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgradeable Abilities</strong> \u2013 Earn points from every battle to boost your bugs\u2019 powers and unlock game-changing tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Chiptune Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 An electrifying retro score that fuels the intensity of each encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Gather your courage, trigger the swarm, and take down every boss in your path!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kill Zilex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858140/8bff4c1c3771db84376016ce0b50d86106abf6e5.jpg"},{"name":"Kill Lithkoz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858140/9660e0c5dd4087fbbe53c67c0cac