rols</strong> \u2013 Tight, responsive platforming and attack inputs demand razor-sharp reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Vivid, handcrafted visuals blending classic nostalgia with modern flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgradeable Abilities</strong> \u2013 Earn points from every battle to boost your bugs\u2019 powers and unlock game-changing tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Chiptune Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 An electrifying retro score that fuels the intensity of each encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Gather your courage, trigger the swarm, and take down every boss in your path!</p>","developers":["Vormela Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858140/a60f2412dfc8ebd0f855b7545892fa1280dd06af/header.jpg?t=1768258803","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858140/499713603/499018ecfb578aa7f14f8e40a4255e47e2cb6dde/1753414183/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753416086","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858140/499713603/499018ecfb578aa7f14f8e40a4255e47e2cb6dde/1753414183/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753416086","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858140/499713603/499018ecfb578aa7f14f8e40a4255e47e2cb6dde/1753414183/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753416086","id":257173698,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173698/98f248bed6559108d31b4af7438fcb814078bfe9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753416086"}],"name":"Don\u2019t Touch the Bug","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":